# rule.require.domain-term-itemization

every **domain term** (noun, verb, adj that composes this repo's declared dobjs and dops) is itemized into `.agent/repo=.this/role=any/briefs/domain.terms/`. one entry per word, REUSED: `stone` serves `Stone`, `getStone`; `gen` serves every `gen*`.

| counts | does NOT count |
|---|---|
| a `DomainEntity`/`DomainLiteral` class name → its nouns/adjs | generic english (`file`, `run`, `data`) |
| a domain.operation name → verb + nouns (`getStone` → `get` + `stone`) | vocab imported from a dependency |
| | a local variable that names no domain concept |

shape: a `choice._.` cluster per term (say, required `.reason`, optional `.example=`), boundary-qualified: `template.domain-term`.

test: *is this word part of a dobj/dop THIS repo declares?* yes → itemize once, reuse · no → out of scope.

blocker: a dobj/dop declared here whose constituent terms are not itemized.
